TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solution in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -equilibrium_phases false
    -totals false
    -molalities false
    -activities false
    -saturation_indices false

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 8
    -print_frequency 1
END
